# What `docker build frontend` can see.
#
# A deny-list, unlike the repo root's: everything here is a build input except the
# three things below. Dropping node_modules is the one that matters — it is ~180
# packages the build reinstalls from the lockfile anyway.

node_modules

# Built by the image itself. Copying a local one in risks shipping a stale bundle.
dist

# tsc -b's incremental cache. A stale one can make `tsc -b` skip the typecheck.
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
